# Reviewed calls, inside a command substitution, to a function that can stop
# the script with `dybatpho::die`. `test/conventions.bats` runs
# `test/die-in-substitution.awk` over the library and fails on any such call
# that is not listed here, because a refusal inside `$(...)` ends only the
# substitution and the caller carries on (AGENT.md, "Never validate inside a
# command substitution").
#
# Before adding a line, fix the call if you can: validate in the caller's shell
# first, return the value through a nameref (`<name>_into`), or read the
# substitution's status on the spot (`|| return $?`). List a call only when the
# refusal it could raise is impossible for the caller's input, and say why.
#
# Format, one entry per line, fields separated by a single tab:
#   file<TAB>function<TAB>callee<TAB>why the call cannot carry on wrongly
# `*` in the file or function field matches any. Blank lines and lines starting
# with `#` are ignored.

# Callees whose only possible refusal is not caller input
*	*	__dybatpho_agent_flatten_schema	reaches dybatpho::die only through the yq/jq check
*	*	__dybatpho_ai_extract_text	reaches dybatpho::die only through the yq/jq check
*	*	__dybatpho_ai_messages_with_system	reaches dybatpho::die only through the yq/jq check
*	*	__dybatpho_ai_tool_invoke	reaches dybatpho::die only through metric-label and stream checks on library literals
*	*	__dybatpho_ai_tools_as_functions	reaches dybatpho::die only through the yq/jq check
*	*	__dybatpho_ai_tools_json	reaches dybatpho::die only through the yq/jq check
*	*	__dybatpho_cli_help_row	refuses only a malformed option spec, the script author's error at definition time
*	*	__dybatpho_cli_help_usage	reaches dybatpho::die only through metric-label and stream checks on library literals
*	*	__dybatpho_cli_suggest_suffix	reaches dybatpho::die only through metric-label and stream checks on library literals
*	*	__dybatpho_file_stat	refuses only an unknown field name; every caller passes a literal
*	*	__dybatpho_log_get_terminal_width	refuses only a non-numeric default, and the default is a literal
*	*	__dybatpho_log_text	library message templates only; refuses a defect in the library's own constants, not caller input
*	*	__dybatpho_log_text_n	library message templates only; refuses a defect in the library's own constants, not caller input
*	*	__dybatpho_log_translate	library message templates only; refuses a defect in the library's own constants, not caller input
*	*	__dybatpho_secret_file_mode	reaches dybatpho::die only through the stat field check
*	*	__dybatpho_secret_file_size	reaches dybatpho::die only through the stat field check
*	*	dybatpho::json_eval	refuses only a missing yq/jq (reported by doctor and the module guards), never caller input
*	*	dybatpho::json_get	refuses only a missing yq/jq (reported by doctor and the module guards), never caller input
*	*	dybatpho::json_object	refuses only a missing yq/jq or an odd field count written in the library, never caller input
*	*	dybatpho::json_query	refuses only a missing yq/jq (reported by doctor and the module guards), never caller input
*	*	dybatpho::path_join	refuses only an empty segment list; every caller passes segments
*	*	dybatpho::string_repeat	count is a literal
*	*	dybatpho::string_truncate	width is a literal
*	*	dybatpho::terminal_height	refuses only a non-numeric default, and the default is a literal
*	*	dybatpho::terminal_width	refuses only a non-numeric default, and the default is a literal

